cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model or its underlying dataset, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "Ghana CLEWISE Model: an integrated model of Ghana's Climate, Land, Energy, Water, Waste, and Industry for all Sectoral Emissions (CLEWISE)"
abstract: >-
  An integrated model of Ghana's Climate, Land, Energy, Water, Waste, and
  Industry for all Sectoral Emissions (CLEWISE). Built in
  OSeMOSYS and underpinned by an open techno-economic dataset compiled with
  Ghanaian national institutions. Includes the model files, source datasheets,
  model inputs, outputs and supporting documentation.
